et of INR 45 lakh across Google Ads and Meta, and has\\ngrown qualified pipeline through HubSpot nurture flows, content-led SEO and disciplined A/B testing.\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\\n\\nDigital Marketing Manager 2023-04 - Present\\nNorthwind Home Essentials (D2C)\\nOwn paid acquisition across Google Ads, Meta Ads and YouTube with a monthly budget of INR 45 lakh; cut\\nblended CAC 22% in 12 months.\\nRebuilt the SEO content program around 40 commercial-intent clusters; organic sessions up 68% and organic\\nrevenue share from 11% to 19%.\\nDesigned HubSpot lifecycle flows (welcome, browse abandon, win-back) that lifted repeat purchase rate by 9\\npoints.\\nIntroduced a weekly A/B testing cadence for landing pages and creatives; 31 tests shipped, 12 winners rolled\\nout.\\nLead a team of 4 (performance, SEO, content, design) and an external agency; report ROAS and contribution\\nmargin to the CMO.\\n\\nSenior Performance Marketing Executive 2020-07 - 2023-03\\nBrightlane Software (B2B SaaS)\\nRan Google Search, LinkedIn Ads and retargeting for a USD 12k/month budget; MQL to SQL conversion\\nimproved from 18% to 27%.\\nBuilt GA4 + HubSpot attribution dashboards that moved budget from low-intent display to search and webinars.\\nLaunched a webinar program (14 events) that sourced 23% of new pipeline in FY2022.\\n\\nMarketing Executive 2018-06 - 2020-06\\nLotus Retail Pvt Ltd\\nManaged social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches.\\nReported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager.\\n\\nPROJECTS\\n\\nFestive Season Campaign 2024 2024-09 - 2024-11\\nPlanned a 6-week multi-channel campaign (search, Meta, influencers, email); hit 132% of revenue target at 3.4x\\nROAS.\\nTechnologies: Google Ads, Meta Ads Manager, HubSpot, GA4, Canva\\n\\nEDUCATION\\n\\nMBA, Marketing 2016 - 2018\\nWestbridge School of Management\\nSpecialization in digital marketing and consumer behaviour.\\n\\nB.Com 2013 - 2016\\nSt. Aldric College\\nFirst class with distinction.\\n\\nSKILLS\\n\\nSEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, HubSpot, Google Analytics, Email Marketing, Content Strategy, A/B Testing,\\nMarketing Automation, Brand Management, Excel, Canva\\nCERTIFICATIONS\\nGoogle Ads Search Certification\\nHubSpot Inbound Marketing Certification\\nGA4 Certification\"}","params":[]}},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"OK","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"Connection","value":"keep-alive"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:40:35 GMT"},{"name":"Keep-Alive","value":"timeout=180"},{"name":"access-control-allow-credentials","value":"true"},{"name":"access-control-allow-origin","value":"http://localhost:3001"},{"name":"content-length","value":"4158"},{"name":"content-type","value":"application/json; charset=utf-8"},{"name":"vary","value":"Origin"}],"content":{"size":-1,"mimeType":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"sections\":{\"personalInfo\":{\"sectionType\":\"personalInfo\",\"content\":{\"fullName\":\"Meera Kapoor\",\"email\":\"meera.kapoor.test@example.com\",\"phone\":\"+91 90000 11111\",\"location\":\"Bengaluru, India\",\"linkedin\":\"linkedin.com/in/meera-kapoor-test\",\"github\":\"\",\"portfolio\":\"Digital Marketing Manager | Performance Marketing, SEO & Marketing Automation\",\"yearsOfExperience\":\"6\",\"dateOfBirth\":\"\",\"nationality\":\"\",\"passport\":\"\",\"passportNo\":\"\",\"passportPlaceOfIssue\":\"\",\"passportDateOfIssue\":\"\",\"passportDateOfExpiry\":\"\",\"maritalStatus\":\"\",\"militaryService\":\"\",\"drivingLicense\":\"\",\"gender\":\"\",\"disability\":\"\",\"visa\":\"\",\"website\":\"\"},\"format\":\"structured\"},\"profileSummary\":{\"sectionType\":\"profileSummary\",\"content\":\"<p>Digital marketing manager with 6 years of experience running performance marketing, SEO and lifecycle programs for D2C and B2B SaaS brands. Owns a monthly paid budget of INR 45 lakh across Google Ads and Meta, and 