>\",\"experience\":[{\"company\":\"Northwind Home Essentials\",\"position\":\"Digital Marketing Manager\",\"location\":\"D2C\",\"startDate\":\"2023-04\",\"endDate\":\"\",\"current\":true,\"description\":\"<ul><li>Own paid acquisition across Google Ads, Meta Ads and YouTube with a monthly budget of INR 45 lakh; cut blended CAC 22% in 12 months.</li><li>Rebuilt the SEO content program around 40 commercial-intent clusters; organic sessions up 68% and organic revenue share from 11% to 19%.</li><li>Designed HubSpot lifecycle flows (welcome, browse abandon, win-back) that lifted repeat purchase rate by 9 points.</li><li>Introduced a weekly A/B testing cadence for landing pages and creatives; 31 tests shipped, 12 winners rolled out.</li><li>Lead a team of 4 (performance, SEO, content, design) and an external agency; report ROAS and contribution margin to the CMO.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"gypb28h0m\"},{\"company\":\"Brightlane Software\",\"position\":\"Senior Performance Marketing Executive\",\"location\":\"B2B SaaS\",\"startDate\":\"2020-07\",\"endDate\":\"2023-03\",\"current\":false,\"description\":\"<ul><li>Ran Google Search, LinkedIn Ads and retargeting for a USD 12k/month budget; MQL to SQL conversion improved from 18% to 27%.</li><li>Built GA4 + HubSpot attribution dashboards that moved budget from low-intent display to search and webinars.</li><li>Launched a webinar program (14 events) that sourced 23% of new pipeline in FY2022.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"jhxwv6v1u\"},{\"company\":\"Lotus Retail Pvt Ltd\",\"position\":\"Marketing Executive\",\"location\":\"\",\"startDate\":\"2018-06\",\"endDate\":\"2020-06\",\"current\":false,\"description\":\"<ul><li>Managed social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches.</li><li>Reported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"0hmoneccp\"}],\"education\":[{\"institution\":\"Westbridge School of Management\",\"degree\":\"MBA in Marketing\",\"field\":\"\",\"startDate\":\"2016\",\"endDate\":\"2018\",\"description\":\"Specialization in digital marketing and consumer behaviour.\",\"id\":\"ajspmnzh2\"},{\"institution\":\"St. Aldric College\",\"degree\":\"B.Com\",\"field\":\"\",\"startDate\":\"2013\",\"endDate\":\"2016\",\"description\":\"First class with distinction.\",\"id\":\"8enm0n8ja\"}],\"projects\":[{\"name\":\"Festive Season Campaign 2024\",\"description\":\"<ul><li>Planned a 6-week multi-channel campaign (search, Meta, influencers, email); hit 132% of revenue target at 3.4x ROAS.</li></ul>\",\"technologies\":[\"Google Ads\",\"Meta Ads Manager\",\"HubSpot\",\"GA4\",\"Canva\"],\"id\":\"3hcvon2qy\",\"startDate\":\"\",\"endDate\":\"\",\"current\":false}],\"skills\":[\"SEO\",\"Google Ads\",\"Meta Ads\",\"HubSpot\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Email Marketing\",\"Content Strategy\",\"A/B Testing\",\"Marketing Automation\",\"Brand Management\",\"Excel\",\"Canva\"],\"certificates\":[{\"title\":\"Google Ads Search Certification\",\"issuer\":\"\",\"issueDate\":\"\",\"id\":\"p5uzzoh3t\"},{\"title\":\"HubSpot Inbound Marketing Certification\",\"issuer\":\"\",\"issueDate\":\"\",\"id\":\"ue4jvb1qf\"},{\"title\":\"GA4 Certification\",\"issuer\":\"\",\"issueDate\":\"\",\"id\":\"m4qgc116b\"}],\"customSections\":[]},\"sectionOrder\":[{\"id\":\"personalInfo\",\"type\":\"personalInfo\",\"title\":\"Personal Information\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"profileSummary\",\"type\":\"profileSummary\",\"title\":\"Summary\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"experience\",\"type\":\"experience\",\"title\":\"Professional Experience\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"education\",\"type\":\"education\",\"title\":\"Education\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"projects\",\"type\":\"projects\",\"title\":\"Projects\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"skills\",\"type\":\"skills\",\"title\":\"Skills\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"languages\",\"type\":\"languages\",\"title\":\"Languages\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"certificates\",\"type\":\"certificates\",\"title\":\"Certificates\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"awards\",\"type\":\"awards\",\"title\":\"Awards\",\"visible\":false}],\"resumeText\":\"Meera Kapoor\\nDigital Marketing Manager | Performance Marketing, SEO & Marketing Automation\\nBengaluru, India · meera.kapoor.test@example.com · +91 90000 11111 · linkedin.com/in/meera-kapoor-test\\nPROFILE SUMMARY\\nDigital marketing manager with 6 years of experience running performance marketing, SEO and lifecycle programs\\nfor D2C and B2B SaaS brands. Owns a monthly paid budget of INR 45 lakh across Google Ads and Meta, and has\\ngrown qualified pipeline through HubSpot nurture flows, content-led SEO and disciplined A/B testing.\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\\n\\nDigital Marketing Manager 2023-04 - Present\\nNorthwind Home Essentials (D2C)\\nOwn paid acquisition across Google Ads, Meta Ads and YouTube with a monthly budget of INR 45 lakh; cut\\nblended CAC 22% in 12 months.\\nRebuilt the SEO content program around 40 commercial-intent clusters; organic sessions up 68% and organic\\nrevenue share from 11% to 19%.\\nDesigned HubSpot lifecycle flows (welcome, browse abandon, win-back) that lifted repeat purchase rate by 9\\npoints.\\nIntroduced a weekly A/B testing cadence for landing pages and creatives; 31 tests shipped, 12 winners rolled\\nout.\\nLead a team of 4 (performance, SEO, content, design) and an external agency; report ROAS and contribution\\nmargin to the CMO.\\n\\nSenior Performance Marketing Executive 2020-07 - 2023-03\\nBrightlane Software (B2B SaaS)\\nRan Google Search, LinkedIn Ads and retargeting for a USD 12k/month budget; MQL to SQL conversion\\nimproved from 18% to 27%.\\nBuilt GA4 + HubSpot attribution dashboards that moved budget from low-intent display to search and webinars.\\nLaunched a webinar program (14 events) that sourced 23% of new pipeline in FY2022.\\n\\nMarketing Executive 2018-06 - 2020-06\\nLotus Retail Pvt Ltd\\nManaged social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches.\\nReported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager.\\n\\nPROJECTS\\n\\nFestive Season Campaign 2024 2024-09 - 2024-11\\nPlanned a 6-week multi-channel campaign (search, Meta, influencers, email); hit 132% of revenue target at 3.4x\\nROAS.\\nTechnologies: Google Ads, Meta Ads Manager, HubSpot, GA4, Canva\\n\\nEDUCATION\\n\\nMBA, Marketing 2016 - 2018\\nWestbridge School of Management\\nSpecialization in digital marketing and consumer behaviour.\\n\\nB.Com 2013 - 2016\\nSt. Aldric College\\nFirst class with distinction.\\n\\nSKILLS\\n\\nSEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, HubSpot, Google Analytics, Email Marketing, Content Strategy, A/B Testing,\\nMarketing Automation, Brand Management, Excel, Canva\\nCERTIFICATIONS\\nGoogle Ads Search Certification\\nHubSpot Inbound Marketing Certification\\nGA4 Certification\",\"fileHash\":\"c2f7b892caa2499145b6ecf41aff41f04beab0535df845212b39dcc51133cb45\",\"fileMetadata\":{\"fileName\":\"marketing-manager.pdf\",\"fileSizeBytes\":76600,\"mimeType\":\"application/pdf\",\"rawTextLength\":2610}}","params":[]}},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"OK","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"Connection","value":"keep-alive"},{"name":"Date","value":"Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:40:54 GMT"},{"name":"Keep-Alive","value":"timeout=180"},{"name":"access-control-allow-credentials","value":"true"},{"name":"access-control-allow-origin","value":"http://localhost:3001"},{"name":"content-length","value":"13899"},{"name":"content-type","value":"application/json; charset=utf-8"},{"name":"vary","value":"Origin"}],"content":{"size":-1,"mimeType":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"token\":\"2w9w3estoeqR4gSswHjpsYIHrhxR0tpb-PbI95R2Yvw\",\"teaser\":{\"score\":25,\"issueCount\":17,\"scoreCap\":25,\"targetRole\":\"Digital Marketing Manager\",\"possibleScore\":95,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"content\",\"label\":\"Content\",\"score\":84,\"issueCount\":4},{\"id\":\"sections\",\"label\":\"Sections\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0},{\"id\":\"atsEssentials\",\"label\":\"ATS Essentials\",\"score\":97,\"issueCount\":1},{\"id\":\"hrRedFlags\",\"label\":\"HR Red Flags\",\"score\":44,\"issueCount\":12},{\"id\":\"discrimination\",\"label\":\"Discrimination\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0},{\"id\":\"seniority\",\"label\":\"Seniority\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0}],\"checksToFix\":[{\"label\":\"Sample Text & Blanks\",\"issueCount\":1,\"impact\":\"high\"},{\"label\":\"Peer Benchmarking\",\"issueCount\":6,\"impact\":\"high\"},{\"label\":\"Credibility\",\"issueCount\":3,\"impact\":\"high\"},{\"label\":\"Interview Risks\",\"issueCount\":3,\"impact\":\"high\"},{\"label\":\"Quantifying Impact\",\"issueCount\":2,\"impact\":\"medium\"},{\"label\":\"Repetition\",\"issueCount\":1,\"impact\":\"medium\"},{\"label\":\"Header Links\",\"issueCount\":1,\"impact\":\"medium\"}]},\"report\":{\"version\":3,\"score\":25,\"scoreCap\":25,\"scoreCapReasons\":[],\"issueCount\":17,\"mode\":\"standalone\",\"inferredProfile\":{\"seniority\":\"Leadership\",\"targetRole\":\"Digital Marketing Manager\",\"isIntern\":false},\"categories\":{\"content\":{\"id\":\"content\",\"label\":\"Content\",\"score\":84,\"issueCount\":4,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"atsParseRate\",\"label\":\"ATS Parse Rate\",\"description\":\"Employers use ATS to scan applications at scale. A high parse rate ensures recruiters can see your experience and skills.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":99,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"parseRate\":99,\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"Great! We parsed 99% of your resume successfully.\"}},{\"id\":\"quantifyingImpact\",\"label\":\"Quantifying Impact\",\"description\":\"Resumes must show measurable impact using numbers, percentages, or scale indicators.\",\"status\":\"warn\",\"score\":67,\"issueCount\":2,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Add a number\",\"description\":\"Marketing Executive at Lotus Retail Pvt Ltd: a measurable result here would make this role stronger for recruiters.\",\"excerpt\":\"Managed social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches.\",\"kind\":\"rewrite\",\"severity\":\"warn\",\"rewriteSuggestion\":\"Managed social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches, resulting in {XX%} increase in engagement.\",\"suggestion\":\"Only if you have a real figure: team size, % improvement, time or cost saved, users, or volume.\"},{\"title\":\"Add a number\",\"description\":\"Marketing Executive at Lotus Retail Pvt Ltd: a measurable result here would make this role stronger for recruiters.\",\"excerpt\":\"Reported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager.\",\"kind\":\"rewrite\",\"severity\":\"warn\",\"rewriteSuggestion\":\"Reported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager, achieving {XX%} improvement in key metrics\",\"suggestion\":\"Only if you have a real figure: team size, % improvement, time or cost saved, users, or volume.\"}],\"scoreMeta\":{\"totalBullets\":10,\"quantifiedBullets\":5,\"metricRolesTotal\":3,\"metricRolesSatisfied\":2},\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"1 role could use a number or two.\",\"stats\":{\"unquantifiedBullets\":2}},\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"What if I'm not in a number-focused role?\",\"answer\":\"Even non-sales roles have quantifiable aspects: team size, users served, latency reduced, tickets resolved, or projects delivered on time.\"}]},{\"id\":\"repetition\",\"label\":\"Repetition\",\"description\":\"Repeating words signals limited vocabulary. Use synonyms and stronger action verbs.\",\"status\":\"warn\",\"score\":80,\"issueCount\":1,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"2 times: organic\",\"description\":\"The word \\\"organic\\\" appears 2 times in the same bullet (2 total), which reads awkwardly even when the achievements differ.\",\"excerpt\":\"Rebuilt the SEO content program around 40 commercial-intent clusters; organic sessions up 68% and organic revenue share from 11% to 19%.\",\"kind\":\"synonym\",\"severity\":\"warn\",\"alternatives\":[\"vary your vocabulary\",\"use stronger verbs\"],\"suggestion\":\"Reword this bullet so \\\"organic\\\" appears once — try: vary your vocabulary, use stronger verbs\"}],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"No issues found.\"},\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"Is repetition necessarily a bad thing?\",\"answer\":\"Repeating technologies or action verbs across different bullets is normal. We only flag awkward repetition — the same word twice in one bullet, or a non-tech term used five or more times with no variation.\"}]},{\"id\":\"spellingGrammar\",\"label\":\"Spelling & Grammar\",\"description\":\"Spelling errors and grammar mistakes are interpreted as unprofessional and can cause immediate rejection.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"No spelling or grammar issues detected.\"}},{\"id\":\"bulletsConsistency\",\"label\":\"Bullets Consistency\",\"description\":\"Bullet points should be 10–35 words — easy to skim without being vague or overly long.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"scoreMeta\":{\"totalBullets\":11,\"outOfRangeBullets\":0},\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"What bullet length should I aim for?\",\"answer\":\"Bullets between 10 and 35 words are easiest for recruiters to scan. Shorter bullets can feel vague; longer ones are harder to skim.\"},{\"question\":\"Do all bullets need to be exactly the same length?\",\"answer\":\"No — consistency in readability matters more than identical word counts. Stay within the recommended range.\"}],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"All your bullets are within the recommended 10–35 word range.\",\"badge\":\"Your bullets are on point\"}},{\"id\":\"placeholderValues\",\"label\":\"Sample Text & Blanks\",\"description\":\"Sample text and blanks like {XX%} print as-is and read as an unfinished resume.\",\"status\":\"warn\",\"score\":66,\"issueCount\":1,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Replace the placeholder\",\"description\":\"Email is sample data: “meera.kapoor.test@example.com”\",\"excerpt\":\"meera.kapoor.test@example.com\",\"severity\":\"fail\"}],\"summary\":{\"stats\":{\"placeholders\":1,\"identity\":1},\"headline\":\"1 placeholder would print as-is.\"}}]},\"sections\":{\"id\":\"sections\",\"label\":\"Sections\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"essentialSections\",\"label\":\"Essential Sections\",\"description\":\"A resume must include properly formatted Experience, Education, and Skills sections.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"What are the essential sections in a resume?\",\"answer\":\"Experience, Education, and Skills (or Summary) are core. ATS parsers look for standard headings and complete contact details.\"}],\"meta\":{\"detectedSections\":[\"Experience\",\"Education\",\"Skills\",\"Summary\",\"Projects\"]},\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"We've found the following essential sections in your resume: Experience, Education, Skills, Summary, Projects.\",\"badge\":\"Complete\"}},{\"id\":\"contactInformation\",\"label\":\"Contact Information\",\"description\":\"Must include name and email. Email, phone, and LinkedIn are checked in contact fields and uploaded PDF text.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"sectionOrder\",\"label\":\"Section Order\",\"description\":\"For experienced professionals, Summary and Experience should appear before Education.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]}]},\"atsEssentials\":{\"id\":\"atsEssentials\",\"label\":\"ATS Essentials\",\"score\":97,\"issueCount\":1,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"fileFormatSize\",\"label\":\"File Format & Size\",\"description\":\"PDF under 2MB is preferred for ATS compatibility and upload limits.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"design\",\"label\":\"Design\",\"description\":\"Design must be structured enough for ATS readability while remaining visually appealing.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"emailAddress\",\"label\":\"Email Address\",\"description\":\"Email should be professional (first/last name), not nicknames.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"headerLinks\",\"label\":\"Header Links\",\"description\":\"Validates URL format for profile links you already added (LinkedIn, GitHub, website, etc.). Links are optional.\",\"status\":\"warn\",\"score\":82,\"issueCount\":1,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"LinkedIn link not a full URL\",\"description\":\"\\\"linkedin.com/in/meera-kapoor-test\\\" should be a visible full URL for ATS parsing.\",\"suggestion\":\"Use https://... format for your LinkedIn link.\"}]},{\"id\":\"fileNameCheck\",\"label\":\"File Name Check\",\"description\":\"Use FirstNameLastName.pdf — avoid version numbers, 'resume', 'final', etc.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"datesLinksConsistency\",\"label\":\"Dates & Links Consistency\",\"description\":\"Date formats and external links should be consistent throughout the resume.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]}]},\"hrRedFlags\":{\"id\":\"hrRedFlags\",\"label\":\"HR Red Flags\",\"score\":44,\"issueCount\":12,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"credibility\",\"label\":\"Credibility\",\"description\":\"Evaluates logical career progression, realistic achievements, and title-responsibility alignment.\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"score\":46,\"issueCount\":3,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Unclear Certification Sources\",\"description\":\"The sources of certifications are not mentioned.\",\"excerpt\":\"Google Ads Search Certification from\",\"fixTitle\":\"HOW TO FIX IT\",\"fixBody\":\"Include the institution or platform from which you obtained the certification.\",\"kind\":\"credibility_risk\"},{\"title\":\"Lack of Specificity in Budget Management\",\"description\":\"The budget management figures are not contextualized.\",\"excerpt\":\"Owns a monthly paid budget of INR 45 lakh across Google Ads and Meta.\",\"fixTitle\":\"HOW TO FIX IT\",\"fixBody\":\"Provide context on how this budget compares to previous budgets or industry standards.\",\"kind\":\"credibility_risk\"},{\"title\":\"Ambiguous Leadership Role\",\"description\":\"The leadership role is not clearly defined.\",\"excerpt\":\"Lead a team of 4 (performance, SEO, content, design)\",\"fixTitle\":\"HOW TO FIX IT\",\"fixBody\":\"Clarify your leadership responsibilities and achievements with the team.\",\"kind\":\"credibility_risk\"}],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"Some credibility risks identified.\",\"strongTrustSignal\":\"The candidate demonstrates strong experience in digital marketing.\",\"mainCredibilityRisk\":\"Unclear sources for certifications and ambiguous leadership roles may raise questions.\"}},{\"id\":\"interviewRisks\",\"label\":\"Interview Risks\",\"description\":\"Pre-identifies weak spots that may trigger tough recruiter questions.\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"score\":46,\"issueCount\":3,\"issues\":[],\"locked\":true},{\"id\":\"peerBenchmarking\",\"label\":\"Peer Benchmarking\",\"description\":\"Compares your profile against peers in your inferred target role.\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"score\":40,\"issueCount\":6,\"issues\":[],\"locked\":true}]},\"discrimination\":{\"id\":\"discrimination\",\"label\":\"Discrimination\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"ageismDateBias\",\"label\":\"Ageism & Date Bias\",\"description\":\"Flags outdated signals like birth dates, legacy email domains, or very old certifications.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]},{\"id\":\"employmentGaps\",\"label\":\"Employment Gaps\",\"description\":\"Identifies unexplained long gaps or clusters of short roles.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[]}]},\"seniority\":{\"id\":\"seniority\",\"label\":\"Seniority\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"careerProgression\",\"label\":\"Career Progression\",\"description\":\"Looks for upward momentum in scope, responsibility, and impact.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"Your career progression reads clearly.\"}},{\"id\":\"skillEvidence\",\"label\":\"Skill Evidence\",\"description\":\"Cross-references Skills section against experience bullet context.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"Skills are well supported by your experience bullets.\"}},{\"id\":\"leadershipSignals\",\"label\":\"Leadership Signals\",\"description\":\"Seeks evidence of mentoring, strategy, and cross-functional coordination.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"score\":100,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[],\"summary\":{\"headline\":\"No issues found.\"}}]},\"tailoring\":{\"id\":\"tailoring\",\"label\":\"Tailoring\",\"score\":0,\"issueCount\":0,\"checks\":[{\"id\":\"hardSkillsMatch\",\"label\":\"Hard Skills Match\",\"description\":\"Compares hard skills in your resume against the job description.\",\"status\":\"skipped\",\"score\":0,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Check skipped\",\"description\":\"Add a job description to unlock tailoring insights.\"}]},{\"id\":\"softSkillsMatch\",\"label\":\"Soft Skills Match\",\"description\":\"Compares soft skills in your resume against the job description.\",\"status\":\"skipped\",\"score\":0,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Check skipped\",\"description\":\"Add a job description to unlock tailoring insights.\"}]},{\"id\":\"actionVerbs\",\"label\":\"Action Verbs\",\"description\":\"Evaluates action verb effectiveness against the job description.\",\"status\":\"skipped\",\"score\":0,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Check skipped\",\"description\":\"Add a job description to unlock tailoring insights.\"}]},{\"id\":\"titleMatch\",\"label\":\"Title Match\",\"description\":\"Checks if your resume title aligns with the target job title.\",\"status\":\"skipped\",\"score\":0,\"issueCount\":0,\"issues\":[{\"title\":\"Check skipped\",\"description\":\"Add a job description to unlock tailoring insights.\"}]}]}},\"strengths\":[\"Strong experience in digital marketing with quantifiable achievements.\",\"Diverse skill set relevant to the target role.\",\"Clear career progression in marketing roles.\",\"ATS Parse Rate: No issues\",\"Spelling & Grammar: No issues\",\"Bullets Consistency: No issues\",\"Essential Sections: No issues\",\"Contact Information: No issues\",\"Section Order: No issues\",\"File Format & Size: No issues\"],\"weaknesses\":[\"Lack of clarity on certification sources.\",\"Some bullets lack quantifiable metrics.\",\"Ambiguity in leadership roles.\"],\"suggestions\":[\"Clarify sources for certifications.\",\"Add quantifiable results to all relevant bullets.\",\"Provide more detail on leadership roles and strategies.\"]}}}"},"headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1,"redirectURL":""},"cache":{},"timings":{"send":-1,"wait":-1,"receive":1.796},"_frameref":"frame@d8f9b073cce98b32f378a6bf4fac8d88","_monotonicTime":22775.302,"_resourceType":"xhr"},{"startedDateTime":"2026-11-24T04:40:54.363Z","time":3.132,"request":{"method":"POST","url":"http://localhost:5004/api/ats-preview/rewrite","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json, text/plain, */*"},{"name":"Accept-Encoding","value":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd"},{"name":"Accept-Language","value":"en-US"},{"name":"Connection","value":"keep-alive"},{"name":"Content-Length","value":"55"},{"name":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"name":"Host","value":"localhost:5004"},{"name":"Origin","value":"http://localhost:3001"},{"name":"Referer","value":"http://localhost:3001/"},{"name":"Sec-Fetch-Dest","value":"empty"},{"name":"Sec-Fetch-Mode","value":"cors"},{"name":"Sec-Fetch-Site","value":"same-site"},{"name":"User-Agent","value":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/159.0