nd disciplined A/B testing.</p>\",\"experience\":[{\"company\":\"Northwind Home Essentials\",\"position\":\"Digital Marketing Manager\",\"startDate\":\"2023-04\",\"endDate\":\"\",\"current\":true,\"location\":\"D2C\",\"description\":\"<ul><li>Own paid acquisition across Google Ads, Meta Ads and YouTube with a monthly budget of INR 45 lakh; cut blended CAC 22% in 12 months.</li><li>Rebuilt the SEO content program around 40 commercial-intent clusters; organic sessions up 68% and revenue share from 11% to 19%.</li><li>Designed HubSpot lifecycle flows (welcome, browse abandon, win-back) that lifted repeat purchase rate by 9 points.</li><li>Introduced a weekly A/B testing cadence for landing pages and creatives; 31 tests shipped, 12 winners rolled out.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"sec_MTV7YkHr5s\"},{\"company\":\"Brightlane Software\",\"position\":\"Senior Performance Marketing Executive\",\"startDate\":\"2020-07\",\"endDate\":\"2023-03\",\"current\":false,\"location\":\"B2B SaaS\",\"description\":\"<ul><li>Ran Google Search, LinkedIn Ads and retargeting for a USD 12k/month budget; MQL to SQL conversion improved from 18% to 27%.</li><li>Built GA4 + HubSpot attribution dashboards that moved budget from low-intent display to search and webinars.</li><li>Launched a webinar program (14 events) that sourced 23% of new pipeline in FY2022.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"sec_ONa9fhM-KI\"},{\"company\":\"Lotus Retail Pvt Ltd\",\"position\":\"Marketing Executive\",\"startDate\":\"2018-06\",\"endDate\":\"2020-06\",\"current\":false,\"location\":\"\",\"description\":\"<ul><li>Managed social media calendar, email campaigns and brand assets for 3 regional store launches, achieving {XX%} improvement in key metrics.</li><li>Reported weekly campaign performance in Google Analytics and Excel to the brand manager, achieving {XX%} improvement in key metrics.</li></ul>\",\"id\":\"sec_nBlQH7F5q3\"}],\"education\":[{\"institution\":\"Westbridge School of Management\",\"degree\":\"MBA\",\"field\":\"Marketing\",\